          "filename": "DiezAlbumsGhazanMausoleum.jpg",
          "caption": "Ghazan Khan's mausoleum and foundation. Illustration of Rashid-ad-Din's Gami' at-tawarih. Tabriz (?), 1st quarter of 14th century. Water colours (and silver?) on paper. Original size: 36.2 cm x 29 cm. Staatsbibliothek Berlin, Orientabteilung, Diez A fol. 70, p. 13.\n\n\"Two turbaned figured are in discussion at the gateway to a religious complex, which Karin Rührdanz plausibly identifies as Ghazan Khan's mausoleum in Tabriz. Note 78 (Diez A fol. 70, p.13)\" The Diez Albums: Contexts and Contents pp.240-241\n\"Sktech of Ghazaniyeh, in Jami al-Tawarikh, written by Rashid al-Din\" p.40 fig.6 left Recognizing the Architectural Form of “Ghazan’s Tomb” in “Abvab-Albar” collection of “Ghazaniyeh” and its Role in Iranian Urbanization Development, 2016, Bagh-e Nazar, University of Tehran",
